        "id": "p38-q12-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find how far east point $B$ is from $A$, correct to 2 decimal places.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$14.77\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "The route is $100^\\circ-90^\\circ=10^\\circ$ south of east. In the right-angled triangle, let $x$ be the eastward distance.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos 10^\\circ &= \\frac{x}{15}\\\\x &= 15\\cos 10^\\circ\\\\x &\\approx 14.77\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p38-q12-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Find how far south point $B$ is from $A$, correct to the nearest millimetre.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$26\\text{ mm}$ ($2.6\\text{ cm}$)",
          "worked": "Using the $10^\\circ$ angle south of east, let $y$ be the southward distance.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin 10^\\circ &= \\frac{y}{15}\\\\y &= 15\\sin 10^\\circ\\text{ cm}\\\\y &= 150\\sin 10^\\circ\\text{ mm}\\\\y &\\approx 26\\text{ mm}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      }
    ]
